              "value": "Rejuvenation"
            },
            "trait_description": {
              "value": "(divine, necromancy)\n\nWhen a mummy pharaoh is destroyed, necromantic energies rebuild its body in its tomb over 1d10 days. If the re-forming body is destroyed during that time, the process starts anew. A slain mummy pharaoh can be destroyed for good with a consecrate ritual."
